@weibaohui/dsh-sidebar-tidy README · @weibaohui/dsh-sidebar-tidy：[](https://github.com/topics/dsh-plugin)
[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@weibaohui/dsh-sidebar-tidy)

**dsh 侧栏收纳**：插件装多了，「新会话」下面被各插件塞满了入口行。本插件把这些入口（全局面板行、插件注入的家族行、底部入口）统统收进一个菜单按钮，点开二级菜单原样触发；想常驻的加白名单即可。

@weibaohui/dsh-sidebar-tidy README · 安装：```bash
dsh plugin --profile web add @weibaohui/dsh-sidebar-tidy -w
```

